l,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-10-03T13:07:17Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T07:41:05Z","closed_at":"2025-10-04T11:34:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- v4.0.stable.official [92bee43ad]\n- v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n- v4.6.dev.custom_build [6d33ad291] (master)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (6d33ad291) - Nobara Linux 42 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (nvidia; 580.82.09) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.25 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using a panel with a stylebox to clip its children and `clip_children` is set to \"Clip Only\", rendering artifacts will appear if the stylebox renders outside the control bounds for any reason (skew, expand margins, shadow, etc.)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba154afb-6111-4e16-aa1d-4c74e65b5039\n\nNote that I tested this on linux with both wayland and x11.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the MRP and open panel.tscn\n\nAlternatively:\n1. Create a scene with a `Panel` and some kind of node that can be clipped as its child.\n2. Change the stylebox of the panel to exceed the regular square bounds (e.g. set a skew value or increase its expand margins)\n3. Set the `Panel`'s `clip_children` property to \"Clip Only\"\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[clip_only_artifacts.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22681168/clip_only_artifacts.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"LunaCapra","id":50772474,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzcyNDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50772474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra","html_url":"https://github.com/LunaCapra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111209/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}